      "tag": "Mean",
      "h2": "Calculating the mean",
      "body_html": "<p>Add all values and divide by the count.</p><p>Data: 2, 4, 6, 8. Sum = 20. Count = 4.</p><p>Mean = 20 ÷ 4 = <strong>5</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Median & Mode",
      "h2": "Finding median and mode",
      "body_html": "<p>Data: 3, 5, 5, 7, 9. Already in order.</p><p>Median = middle value = <strong>5</strong>.</p><p>Mode = most common = <strong>5</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Range",
      "h2": "Calculating the range",
      "body_html": "<p>Data: 2, 5, 8, 11, 15.</p><p>Range = largest − smallest = 15 − 2 = <strong>13</strong>.</p>"
    }
